{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "f7ad6192-47ca-4654-985b-96b88644ddb9",
		"name": "Session Service",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "50955450",
		"_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/50955450-f7ad6192-47ca-4654-985b-96b88644ddb9?source=collection_link",
		"description": "Session REST workflow through Gateway → custom Message Broker → Session. Run Setup first, then the session requests in order. The internal operations folder calls the broker directly. Configure base_url (Gateway) and broker_url (broker HTTP API). End-session success means its results were committed to the outbox; Player receives shift_ended asynchronously over gRPC. Native gRPC methods use src/proto/message_broker.proto and src/proto/server-moderation-session.proto; they are not HTTP requests in this collection. The automated regression test covers the decision-concurrency race."
	},
